The domain receives `resident` as a plain fact, so the postal-code lookup stays behind `ResidentRegistry`. A family of two adults, an 8-year-old and a 4-year-old pays 18 + 18 + 9 + 0 = 45.00. Twelve adults pay 216.00 − 32.40 = 183.60. The injected `today` should be the start of the current day, so a visit later today is not rejected as past.

